<title>GERMANY: Irish Fin Min Quinn says interest climate positive.</title>
<headline>Irish Fin Min Quinn says interest climate positive.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish Finance Minister Ruairi Quinn said on Tuesday that the climate for Irish interest rates was currently extremely positive.</p>
<p>&quot;The overall climate for Irish interest rates is extremely positive, it is maybe the best it has been in 25 years,&quot; Quinn told journalists after the monthly meeting of the European Monetary Institute in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
